ct of Uttarakhand was more important to it.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/entirely-unbecoming-in-a-democracy-pushkar-dhami-slams-kharge-over-remarks-against-pm-modi/articleshow/135212892.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/entirely-unbecoming-in-a-democracy-pushkar-dhami-slams-kharge-over-remarks-against-pm-modi/articleshow/135212892.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-26T18:49:25+05:30</pubDate><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135212891,imgsize-85064.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Broke locks, scaled walls: Congress MPs named in Jamia FIR amid students' unrest]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/broke-locks-scaled-walls-congress-mps-named-in-jamia-fir-amid-students-unrest/articleshow/135212570.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135212570.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/broke-locks-scaled-walls-congress-mps-named-in-jamia-fir-amid-students-unrest/articleshow/135212570.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/broke-locks-scaled-walls-congress-mps-named-in-jamia-fir-amid-students-unrest/articleshow/135212570.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-26T18:32:15+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Vijaya Srivastava</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135212638,imgsize-194850.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA['Modi kahi nahi jaayega': BJP's message to 'anti-Indian' forces ahead of INDIA bloc's rally on Nov 1]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/modi-kahi-nahi-jaayega-bjps-message-to-anti-indian-forces-ahead-of-india-blocs-rally-on-nov-1/articleshow/135212427.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left"