</item><item><title><![CDATA[‘More they do it, stronger PDA gets’: Akhilesh Yadav alleges 'misinformation campaign' against SP-Congress alliance]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/more-they-do-it-stronger-pda-gets-akhilesh-yadav-alleges-misinformation-campaign-against-sp-congress-alliance/articleshow/135211980.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135211980.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/more-they-do-it-stronger-pda-gets-akhilesh-yadav-alleges-misinformation-campaign-against-sp-congress-alliance/articleshow/135211980.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/more-they-do-it-stronger-pda-gets-akhilesh-yadav-alleges-misinformation-campaign-against-sp-congress-alliance/articleshow/135211980.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-26T18:12:05+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Karan Manral</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135212246,imgsize-92144.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[SBI inaugrates centre of excellence for cybersecurity]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/sbi-inaugrates-centre-of-excellence-for-cybersecurity/articleshow/135210809.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135210809.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[The inauguration of CyRIS by SBI marks a significant step in advancing cybersecurity measures and threat intelligence in finance. Centered around THINK, INNOVATE, and DEFEND, it promotes a cooperative approach among banks, fintechs, and regulators to strengthen resilience. CS Setty, SBI chairman, underscored that bolstering cybersecurity is crucial for maintaining customer trust and proactively addressing threats, alongside regular training for employees and raising customer awareness on digital safety.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/sbi-inaugrates-centre-of-excellence-for-cybersecurity/articleshow/135210809.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/sbi-inaugrates-centre-of-excellence-for-cybersecurity/articleshow/135210809.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-26T17:06:51+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Mayur Shetty</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135210855,imgsize-90408.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Congress to hold ‘Vote Bachao' rally at Ramlila Maidan on Nov 1; Amit Shah to lead padayatra in T'gana on Nov 2]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/congress-to-hold-vote-bachao-rally-at-ramlila-maidan-on-nov-1-amit-shah-to-lead-padayatra-in-tgana-on-nov-2/articleshow/135209356.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135209356.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[Congress party president Mallikarjun Kharge announced a rally in New Delhi to protest vote theft allegations. The rally, titled 'Vote Bachao, Desh Bachao,' aims to challenge the special electoral roll revision process. Meanwhile, BJP leader Amit Shah will participate in a counter-march in Telangana on November 2. The political tension arises from differing accusations regarding electoral irregularities and vote deletions.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/congress-to-hold-vote-bachao-rally-at-ramlila-maidan-on-nov-1-amit-shah-to-lead-padayatra-in-tgana-on-nov-2/articleshow/135209356.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/congress-to-hold-vote-bachao-rally-at-ramlila-maidan-on-nov-1-amit-shah-to-lead-padayatra-in-tgana-on-nov-2/articleshow/135209356.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-26T16:32:44+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Vijaya Srivastava</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135210047,imgsize-72042.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[DMK’s ‘maternal uncle’ jibe at CM Vijay over women’s safety in Tamil Nadu]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/dmks-maternal-uncles-gift-jibe-at-cm-vijay-over-womens-safety-in-tamil-nadu/articleshow/135209043.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135209043.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/dmks-maternal-uncles-gift-jibe-at-cm-vijay-over-womens-safety-in-tamil-nadu/articleshow/135209043.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/dmks-maternal-uncles-gift-jibe-at-cm-vijay-over-womens-safety-in-tamil-nadu/articleshow/135209043.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-26T16:20:03+05:30</pubDate><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135209509,imgsize-49384.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA['Thank God Ram didn't hit minority': UP CEO on caste bias allegations over voter slips row]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/thank-god-ram-didnt-hit-minority-up-ceo-on-caste-bias-allegations-over-voter-slips-row/articleshow/135209197.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135209197.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/thank-god-ram-didnt-hit-minority-up-ceo-on-caste-bias-allegations-over-voter-slips-row/articleshow/135209197.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/thank-god-ram-didnt-hit-minority-up-ceo-on-caste-bias-allegations-over-voter-slips-row/articleshow/135209197.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-26T16:00:09+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Rohitashwa Ranjan</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135209238,imgsize-102616.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[BJP protests across states over Kharge's 'baap' remark at PM Modi; demands apology]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/bjp-stages-protests-in-bihar-jammu-bengaluru-over-kharges-baap-remark-against-pm-modi-demands-apology/articleshow/135208123.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135208123.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[In response to Mallikarjun Kharge's recent remarks about Prime Minister Narendra Modi, BJP activists took to the streets in various locations including Bihar, Jammu, and Bengaluru. The protests, spearheaded by local BJP leaders, called for an official apology from Kharge. While Congress rallied behind Kharge, the BJP accused him of demonstrating a lack of respect towards Modi and his family, igniting a national debate on political respect and decorum.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/bjp-stages-protests-in-bihar-jammu-bengaluru-over-kharges-baap-remark-against-pm-modi-demands-apology/articleshow/135208123.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/bjp-stages-protests-in-bihar-jammu-bengaluru-over-kharges-baap-remark-against-pm-modi-demands-apology/articleshow/135208123.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-26T15:54:16+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Mahima Sharma</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135209553,imgsize-2246931.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Rahi’s native land seek recognition for literary legacy]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timeso